  hints:
  - "Su perfil sonoro combina m\xFAsica brit\xE1nica y m\xFAsica alemana con una
    presencia instrumental muy marcada."
  - "El cat\xE1logo incluye el \xE1lbum \xABHow To Train Your Dragon (Music From
    The Motion Picture)\xBB."
  - Entre sus colaboraciones registradas figuran Hans Zimmer y Harry Gregson-Williams.
  - "Entre sus temas m\xE1s identificables est\xE1n \xABTest Drive - From How To
    Train Your Dragon Music From The Motion Picture\xBB y \xABRomantic Flight - From
    How To Train Your Dragon Music From The Motion Picture\xBB."
  - "Artista o grupo detr\xE1s de \xABTest Drive - From How To Train Your Dragon
    Music From The Motion Picture\xBB, \xABRomantic Flight - From How To Train Your
    Dragon Music From The Motion Picture\xBB y \xABOogway Ascends\xBB."
